# S10 Red Alert SCG10EA (snow): the Soviet base with its tech centre, the four missile
# silos and the mine field; framed at tick 1 and tick 300, then the silos and the yard
# are damaged and framed again.
game: ra
scen: SCG10EA
modes: enh,cls,n64
---
